            <note corresp="#d213-f2" n="2" xml:id="d213-f2-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d211">Document 211</ref>. On April 27 the Department informed
                    the Embassies in Thailand, Australia, the Philippines, Vietnam, Korea, and New
                    Zealand of the DRV message and this reply in
                    telegram 154614. (National Archives and Records Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1967–69, POL 27–14 VIET/CROCODILE)</p>
            </note>
